        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "## Quarantine and QN (part 1/3)\n### Q: Does every mention of a child need quarantine?\nNo. A harmless mention in a school, family or otherwise safe context does not establish a trigger by itself. Evaluate the surrounding content for any separate concern."
      },
